%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-timer-functions-duration (関数ページ)
実行ごとに変わる部分は %%% mask / %%% env / %%% variants で扱う (docs/fixtures.md)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
fun myFunction() = dw::Runtime::wait("My result",100)
---
dw::util::Timer::duration(() -> myFunction())
%%% mask
"time": (\d+)
%%% output application/json
{
  "time": 101,
  "result": "My result"
}
